---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../config/site';

const title = "Digital Marketing Services | SKYON IT SOLUTIONS";
const description = "We provide digital marketing services including paid campaigns, campaign strategy, landing pages, analytics, and conversion optimization.";
const currentUrl = `${SITE.url}/services/digital-marketing`;

const breadcrumbSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": SITE.url },
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Services", "item": `${SITE.url}/#services` },
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Digital Marketing", "item": currentUrl }
  ]
};

const serviceSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Service",
  "name": "Digital Marketing",
  "provider": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "SKYON IT SOLUTIONS", "url": SITE.url },
  "url": currentUrl,
  "description": description
};
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumbSchema)} />
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(serviceSchema)} />
  </Fragment>
  
  <article class="pt-32 pb-24 px-4 md:px-8 max-w-[48rem] mx-auto">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-8 text-sm text-text-disabled">
      <ol class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-brand-hover transition-colors">Home</a></li>
        <li><span aria-hidden="true">/</span></li>
        <li><a href="/#services" class="hover:text-brand-hover transition-colors">Services</a></li>
        <li><span aria-hidden="true">/</span></li>
        <li class="text-text-primary" aria-current="page">Digital Marketing</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-text-primary tracking-tight mb-8">Digital Marketing</h1>
    
    <div class="text-text-body space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Digital marketing encompasses the tactics used to reach audiences online and direct them toward your business goals. We focus on structured campaign execution, measurement, and optimization.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-12 mb-4">Understanding the Marketing Ecosystem</h2>
      <p>
        Modern digital marketing requires a coordinated approach across multiple disciplines. A successful initiative typically begins with a clear campaign strategy that defines the target audience, the messaging, and the most appropriate channels for distribution. Rather than relying on assumptions, digital marketing utilizes analytics data to track user interactions and measure the effectiveness of the chosen strategy.
      </p>
      <p>
        An ecosystem functions best when traffic generation and user experience are aligned. Generating traffic through advertising is only the first step; the destination page must clearly communicate the offer and provide a friction-free path to conversion.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-12 mb-4">Our Focus Areas</h2>
      <p>
        We construct and manage digital marketing efforts covering the following components:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Campaign Strategy:</strong> We map out the channels, messaging, and audience targeting for your marketing initiatives.</li>
        <li><strong>Paid Campaigns:</strong> We plan and set up paid campaigns.</li>
        <li><strong>Landing Pages:</strong> We design and build specific destination pages tailored to campaign messaging.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics and Conversion Optimization:</strong> We use analytics to understand how visitors respond and where the path to enquiry can improve.</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        These components are designed to work together sequentially. Paid campaigns are deployed across search engines or social networks to drive initial awareness and route targeted traffic to specialized landing pages. Analytics tracking provides quantitative insight into how those visitors behave upon arrival, which then informs the conversion optimization process to systematically test and improve the user flow.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-12 mb-4">Our Process</h2>
      <p>
        Our digital marketing projects are structured around the following phases:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Understand:</strong> We learn about the business and goals.</li>
        <li><strong>Strategize:</strong> We plan the approach.</li>
        <li><strong>Build:</strong> We do the work.</li>
        <li><strong>Launch:</strong> We launch the campaigns.</li>
        <li><strong>Grow:</strong> We review and improve.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-12 mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <details class="group border-b border-hairline py-4">
        <summary class="font-bold cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-primary text-text-primary">What is conversion optimization?</summary>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base">Conversion optimization is the methodical process of analyzing visitor behavior on a website or landing page and making adjustments to increase the percentage of users who take a desired action, such as filling out a form or clicking a specific button.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="group border-b border-hairline py-4">
        <summary class="font-bold cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-primary text-text-primary">Why use dedicated landing pages for paid campaigns?</summary>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base">Dedicated landing pages allow marketers to match the page content exactly to the message of the advertisement that brought the user there. This continuity reduces user confusion and can help compared to sending traffic to a generic homepage.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="group border-b border-hairline py-4">
        <summary class="font-bold cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-primary text-text-primary">What role do analytics play in digital marketing?</summary>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base">Analytics platforms provide quantitative data on how users discover and navigate digital properties. This data helps marketing professionals identify which channels are driving the most relevant traffic and which areas of a campaign may require adjustment.</p>
      </details>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-hairline">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">Ready to discuss your project?</h3>
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-button-fill text-text-primary px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-semibold hover:bg-brand-hover transition-colors shadow-sm">
        Contact Us
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-hairline flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm font-medium">
      <span class="text-text-disabled">Other Services:</span>
      <a href="/services/website-development" class="text-brand-primary hover:text-brand-hover">Website Development</a>
      <a href="/services/seo" class="text-brand-primary hover:text-brand-hover">Search Engine Optimization</a>
      <a href="/services/social-media" class="text-brand-primary hover:text-brand-hover">Social Media Management</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
